{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1477,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711d80986a272fffe1638402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的幸运食物就决定是\n星鳗和海鳗了♪\n白烧和蒲烧我都要试一下☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "194055ba142ce1cac2340749b1f4c9266d6077636f5d07781769a40d6c48d4e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd7dec9176df7316ee73a82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想改造一下食堂入口啊~！\n地垫颜色还有花的种类什么的……\n都让我来布置一下吧~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d46260dc89864689879f512b147b94f786f90d59a21f8f4bb7017202b65fd0e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf4e4cae17cb709d0ae279d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上打开窗户想换换气的时候，\n偶尔会听见地方歌谣传进来。\n……火山她很努力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8592582746b67564bbdc0744d03dea2bef443939f29fa5f972905bd3446f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc419458ce0d2c9a8fc878bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离别会带来新的邂逅——\n就像不间断的音乐一样。\n祝愿你被气运温柔眷顾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c675dba97e1e60ad67b0da83ecb17e5948a1c62e5f9af8caf09a9fb336003945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a46bfd5bac5ecc51e6e8166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子说，要去参加夏日庆典\n寻找演出灵感~！\n感觉她会得到满满的大地之力呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fec143e1d826c3e51578f4c3d47d16757ffe8202248b2c9b9d5dd2846ac1239b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5fecf8e38cd08670b5ec60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃秋味太上头的人呀……\n悄悄教你一招，风水减肥！\n悄悄地感谢悄悄地沾上好运☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "25aa4810f86229cae205fa04f8007a1b53bcb8054952329e8f1223e1de871614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f29bccfe5dc2ef365209b45e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天冷了就喝蚬子味噌汤！\n防感冒加才能UP的风水秘术……\n咦？芭蕾同学也很熟悉风水吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07d2eb3df3a1ff44c4c40b4bba78886d5c96bc8d1f036804a49697d2d33441c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ffbe1f35984808a59a1ecd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想锻炼直觉就穿华丽衣服……没错，\n就是能在黑黑的房间里发光的那种！\n和飞鹰子一起就是双重风水☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "faf831ea7b31fd3d5ecaa9ac0b116868c9040a2571fc20a19b873d8c98207fce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b84c466aea12c2381380df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？八角形是八方位的象征。\n很吉利哦！这件衣服上Copa地藏有\n这种图案……来找找看吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0eb2d5e68bc6ea5dd7f6eeb84b4ef40f09502a4e7923326d4d924969599a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80508780f898b87238e0f302",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从我的房间看出去的吉位在这边！\r\n在这训练一定会很有效果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47e2a9090de7787cb8b3350bac8b732465caed4842c5e381f59c57edf4b6fbd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d13122c917efa68b439dda24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d1415a904efcfccb18e61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好很好！\r\n这个训练内容，\r\n感觉能吸引许多阳气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "333833cadd6c191d37a9bdb28303d7156eeca0684a72d37048d7422ff9f6c67b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29b971a195d840a1e98e860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\r\nCopaCopa的开运训练，\r\n要开始啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4796f72a69b530536c1799b31a53279aa4b8ebfe53b82d86fa456d341fea132b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa803d33cac824eaf2bdcede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分析气的流向，\r\n正确地施力……\r\n嗯，假想训练非常完美！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d45a527160fa1fec49a1ad0dd9a7e8dec7cf60bc689ea24082aba92dd39d9313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d5d8abb6e468d415b46f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练也很Happy☆Lucky☆\r\n因为大地和你的声音，\r\n会告诉我气的流向！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabc0f6fa3784a88d38187574976aac6712a436eec46a7659dd3bedb3096bf08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e390900de9a2e6a547ac98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信者得救？不对，\r\n是相信并努力的人能够获得回报！\r\n就像我们这样☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc104645b74e679118c5286191fc4d45fa206e520d1df3662a8d73cd6086408b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6070416b95f89c3a5f05ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员相信风水，并全力支持我！\r\n所以我绝对会用比赛的结果，\r\n让你变得happy！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64b13e941f390009406ec467e2390f8a624460cd8b3855926c06bd2d1e8b0008",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d87163f36d774b2c3b95aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真龙──这里的龙脉走势很不错，\r\n是个充满力量的地方，\r\n非常适合举办集训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a298a87642efc93d1f1632853451f82300b0aff01ba8f7aada7a83e73bc8c97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56261262508be818c5fc4de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阴气和阳气，奔跑和休息。\n风水也好训练也好，\n中庸是最重要的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5571edf236eea47e6d31d599fbb872b1603d079d06b6d0659fc36a901d316aa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da925ebb1886848566d7695d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\n全力冲刺☆\n大地的力量，我感受到了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dede70348fa3c5b29c3f41e5bca3e888a74003e60dfa393844fafcec72c7f04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:010ec5bf13de27d38185e66b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量、体能、还有灵感！\n全都提升到了最棒的吉位，\n我都调查好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "410a26f0dfc97b83b9b7d1b22416c49e64929c31547d9c6db5a655ec3bcb021f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ee2f9eca341442829d49bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的是心中的信念☆\n以风水为伙伴，注定会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a48116b04f5b170762c400220f0f04fbc5ce309c9c0fc516a73de6afe9aabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a56e7d6ae53c15eb6d542b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "静下心来倾听……听到了吧，\n由“气”演奏出来的旋律☆今天的\n训练选什么好可以告诉我一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0aebab71f8859a79423ff8a8af3a57d12704c936b59ccd1be6ffdf6c74830f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb982f1e3f353b2abb1048f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天你的声调是……嗯嗯！\n和往常一样，充满了希望！\n让气场和节奏合拍起来吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd8b026452756b6bcc4ceb42bbd0b8abbcf2e0c93df5ee04fe6d1d4608f0013",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a13db95dc77d13a566e6e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的气，还有你的声音……\n是共同跨越苦乐的灵魂旋律！\n简直就是最完美的和鸣呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dcacd81aa21689c4922f69b3eda95eeda3672b9dcc7a08733a0202712dfb297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77dd8fd3dd2b5056cda2cc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们透过相生──\r\n实现了梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db56aeb5a4b485b9a281b355090652166d53b6e90d2d418c7825502ea8b0696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b57da24213e6026509a80846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能走到今天这一步，\r\n真的是太happy了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5b81a22f9ca0d93c75636f0d201374ad274f1f0cbdb8d22923822aed502ab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7273e9abef0d076bc24286cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能和你共鸣，是我最大的幸福哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "006f9afa67d5a142f2aa1f20c68aaa950952302254d0d9ba9e2ec825dcd7bf53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db29b5711beabd0daa18f5da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这开运的和声☆\n是我们一起演奏的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a3cca4e692b6c16fb3e9cbd81a255e45355346fdadb378b41f0e9358a79d039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b64b08d33eb213921e2f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的气聚集过来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4b289e895005310d50f616f925da8bc753f2f963ee59b7c925d74d55cbd17b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26338e9fbe3b55f93de6a9d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\r\n大、大、开运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a115705b019a73d73de2bc120da1c709cf01b7a87a1af360286bbc6560d161",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d12bff48378e199a4a9d50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是小林历奇！\r\n将为你带来幸运喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff1c3a697e93ab2e6e929c89a951ea319343c531d37c022c11414a08861d0ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7d255fbed5c4b0a2238c0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "龙穴砂水──\r\n我听得见大地的「声音」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "166c333cf0f7ebcd9f07a3b68bf62704b3180505a30af3caa90a75562083a01f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d32ef7c7b6beacf7fd31dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来帮你开运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d1187233c7d0a3442c61df026bd6613db67213ca189fd2d706db9d2f2dc648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f60e676518b81cd64efbc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量好像变强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fa72336d8a3dfe2fcaff2f9fd5c6d8a4614b962ad615e0deb592f625c36cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a886d84e1039226697fbc3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美好的未来，被照亮了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fc0020ce343349a574b4233f807287e01c4ac78fc862fc794e881b9452bc38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa13669fd6abe49457697a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听到了哦，这祝福的响声♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bad45ad62ec6aed63e75dbe023326a080d1312fd5b2452d7aac8a256d59345a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:955589b65b45793aeda29b4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阴阳五行的旋律♪\n奏响吧☆幸运的开场号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a536897c6e53a49ed4692b3149311d084ca5613bd557302633e74fc005596a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec61ae6fb01b2a76525cb327",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是小林历奇！\n奏响吧，幸运的旋律♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4a16eba00bc57eced29fd96cb1f0ee2bc8ef8b071513a1208d667c6f45d057",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d01a6196ed88c0ab6c024ca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70cf5af384b541c95e8c097e3524903e779ce3bb87c95addd7d74ba0114e8ffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd18f6ee80ab4dccbc4d8731",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苫小牧的大家都在守护着我……\r\n我想成为一个能抬头挺胸地\r\n面对他们的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c96dddb830aacce9f383096de5aadd0ffa9d868e49a74c5029a7ff3d030a5a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b8879e1728d32fd703fe9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5288425deb234d8c126818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "957219cb55ec945751355da9fccb1ec932616c20f56165eda9b50ec8e13aa356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a067ab1627a5875d182470fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定能够持续努力下去。\r\n因为我遇见了喜欢上苫小牧，\r\n并愿意在身边支持我的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09517fda735d5e58b702c23faf72a839100ea17dc7241d2eb8ec82234f99dbd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc56ff523768693e4c9625d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不需要改变自己，\r\n认真又固执的我也很好……呵呵，\r\n这是我待在训练员身边找到的答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5936b2d584648461fe0dc9fbabfe681007f3106981df62464fa052d374d4317b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7f365cb875452f361a2f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将关照过我的人们送的\r\n贺年卡都保管起来了。\r\n这种连系真的很重要呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5021d2849613d9a89ecc0a3c0ca3374405d31cbc76062eb1a574e4ec4ddbffde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c62fb639e3704f93cbea07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之前送你的蓝靛果巧克力蛋糕\r\n你有吃了吗？为了制作新名产，\r\n请你有意见尽管直说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa32f7321145fd0bb090f121685e3ed38892911e17251a0b1725a077c572c26b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208d7f8f79a70e972ce5d17c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我去上点心教室并反复试做后，\r\n才终于完成的……那个，\r\n如果能合你的口味，那就太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26bff22202109edc313957cc8a7bfe5bc26dc552a57e7d862e73fe119cc85030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a325c0910fd36eeed08b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每每在七夕活动演出时，我都会\r\n为苫小牧祈愿……而最终得到的\r\n结论是，我必须更努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da134941dff294a1081c7c9c6ed5040377a9fa26d6fa2314d5dd34e9f293ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e678ad20f710a5fe11c38da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用蓝靛果做了\r\n有万圣节气氛的紫色点心！\r\n我想让大家尝尝苫小牧的味道……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9542759b5d751025c2a9643b3c3d3319012f09d703b13c62994daa7e1d87e53f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b66de4195b6187c87dea07d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前曾在活动中打扮成圣诞老人，\r\n在溜冰的同时抛礼物给观众……\r\n真令人怀念呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "976857a372fc786e387ddb782532b2c42bae862aee24d47a036dd4c1438bc378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26d54496def4a9a2da0187b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苫小牧有个经典行程是去看\r\n船只点灯。希望我们有一天……\r\n可以一起……去看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ea3616d1ca61a16f1b091f60139f372e08dc4215420b483004d454f72ec93f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0adfb62d89c461beaff5b0a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好！成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14a4a0326d2e6a5194b6c866a99087597f153e49782a780bef94f168b92923f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76bcffd8caef78feba6d369c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每年大扫除都非常辛苦。\r\n例如收到的礼物、活动用的道具……\r\n总之我东西很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0655da17d0c066c5b60b867d7799143263cbab8b3a1fc0b831bb5c3ce2f5649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb4e8387c36d84628ab44fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n为了回报你平日的照顾，\r\n今天由我担任派对的主持人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "645cc2e72d74342d1d88594a01fd63d08c0e17d2acfecf81338f771f252ad13d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe769827d1110b81db0d4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用蓝靛果与花楸\r\n做了一个花框。\r\n希望……你会喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff2bed7dc59dfe1e27b287ac2ed50795cc83ad8571cf63f21c557007eb7653d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:444001336b9b40cb90ad5f4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日。我每年都会\r\n收到许多来自故乡的礼物……\r\n此外，也会收到护身符。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1755a2a353c91748f2d6194404fe79fdddd636b02053f0b622de5879bdd5718a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9397d6cb1cd7e82bf5243d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想邀请你参加一个活动……\r\n呃，就是、我的庆生会。\r\n不、不介意的话，请务必参加！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ceec0b81f1f0baa94c333b9b80591e6fe7014d09d018ba4f626f719dca3cf08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67d5ef961b7dfc50be48741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有、有新的公告！\r\n必须确认一下……啊，对不起，\r\n是给训练员的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd3683f7866cdacb57696fbcf45fed03d7a5614cc5a14169617d022c1f6d5de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9769f8e4419a29f550b5d08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊，有人送礼物来了！\r\n真是令人开心。\r\n趁忘记之前去领取吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55af8ade5ea82c08923315a0635c07a78029cf840cbdbc14f6902e9f2a9ef84a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23dc3529969fccfac847012b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成！太厉害了！\r\n我也要加油才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc87e6248facdd344517786a6314d857e18b79e9660362d871a1eca9903477d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9e15ba1afdf6d505e14501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像要开始了。\r\n这是……宣传苫小牧的好机会！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82c7e38ad558c0b172548db86abf36399d93b95fcaf891e9c333e2a3d674666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e62efd200da19e2d57294731",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动的气氛好像很热烈呢。\r\n身为地方偶像，\r\n我不能错过这个机会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a605f5f4d8c90f35c0262661724676bde4c5426d41136d2ae4dec57439d5a7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2304e745b177411ecfef6a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把经验活用到下次比赛吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd3dbca69b351af1380e7060dbd21a7643fe4c5d1b47e0e1bc3dc066266b1dc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:904344166edf82e8d59b997a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了。\r\n去确认一下训练员努力的成果吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "732662040a27fab036919c6a078cd06766ad287feb05c720c2595c7bd378e03f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8f1273abd2b3a3a560ab0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遵循地方偶像的印象，\n私服在坚持朴素可爱风的同时\n……帽子就是我的个人讲究了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "703cbc6b1b36bd15383c118e1b9a15c07fc15ada8e177e115afb39a1cdd7404f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e414159405e32d7094801e9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作和休息的界限我向来\n区分得很清楚……但被粉丝们\n注意到的时候我还是会很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68d36f074936b2a2cfcd8f9298af62acb1a21d6850b45f49f0becc7a32d11b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abdaf00df361953d6b9984ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打算好好研究时尚相关的东西。\n换句话说，就是要了解当前的趋势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10385b54f2676e838722eee94cad3ee7eff9414c443ccf3935e5f3496a542bc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d042dc34f3920d1d8202bc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们都很努力了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9629595114355c337662124da82048d5e962bab83988ef6c129186e245dcbfd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de712d151a64eb9e262a4208",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都很耀眼喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11dfb18f0aee8eb03c1dd97c75a92828bed39dee19c181b84ed6a2e0cb00ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c5a413649d43f3bc15a240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把经验活用到下次比赛吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd3dbca69b351af1380e7060dbd21a7643fe4c5d1b47e0e1bc3dc066266b1dc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4640cc1fc47c8c43a3914a67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们都很努力了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9629595114355c337662124da82048d5e962bab83988ef6c129186e245dcbfd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d803e94f20018e5cebad57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了，创下高分纪录了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "948e85e5e683907c15ec0f044fe978dc57dea7b59f74d4c657c3c91adccbbe5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4372fbf983fc88674f78f3b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起绽放光芒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3544133244f2cf3e0b3c97454e07f00d999c935a330d93e7cbfe89060ef44884",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d839addf8dbc72b74099796b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48dada5f3dab84ccd4006476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果想早日达成目标，\r\n就只有努力一途，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b76d4211d6c42cc0bc902230e4b7a487d232c4a859ac19120f01c25d53e6366",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e163515790a789057510d89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园跟苫小牧的街道一样，\r\n充满了历史呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe65bb1a2c296a3b1e5a23bdb8a2888c2a81db0f0c3d00d518b45df1cf9615b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70df2788fa713c3c437aaed4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿下第一名，\r\n争取宣传的机会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc05e546289586acc8dd9dd2559e24bea7516fae13bc00bbab9e8a9ab8db666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a3013bba0a6674c80dcd0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了苫小牧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "289770348aa051460db499717b957fc498f93bd21cd8dd60a0a63c890d6f4ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83457f9361f9c3591a0927fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞跃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79511b159fa8bc91e3a469fb9d9e7c1f5e046456749f1740df1c7336805db25e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "1154"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
